  "$description": "Which platforms carry each component. `components` is explicit for every slug — there is no \"absent means everywhere\" rule, so a newly added platform can never be silently claimed for a component that does not have it. GENERATED from components.manifest.json by `pnpm gen:manifest` — edit the manifest, not this file. Consumed by apps/web/src/lib/platform-parity.ts and scripts/gen-registry-index.mjs.",
